 cinematic 16:9 keyframe for: In a fictional amber-lit workshop, an elderly clockmaker tightens one brass screw on a palm-sized mechanical bird. The bird wakes, tests both wings, and lands beside a blue enamel teacup.. Preserve the supplied identity, wardrobe, location, prop state, and visual style. Clear subject staging, readable action, natural light, no text, no watermark.\",\"keyframe_asset_id\":\"clockmaker-shot-keyframe\",\"metadata\":{},\"order\":1,\"original_prompt\":\"In a fictional amber-lit workshop, an elderly clockmaker tightens one brass screw on a palm-sized mechanical bird. The bird wakes, tests both wings, and lands beside a blue enamel teacup.\",\"references\":[{\"description\":\"Generated reusable style anchor\",\"order\":1,\"provenance\":\"image_generation\",\"reference_id\":\"asset-style-bible\",\"role\":\"style_bible\",\"source_asset_id\":\"style-bible\"}],\"shot_id\":\"clockmaker-shot\",\"title\":\"The Clockwork Bird\"}],\"source_input\":{\"metadata\":{},\"prompt\":\"In a fictional amber-lit workshop, an elderly clockmaker tightens one brass screw on a palm-sized mechanical bird. The bird wakes, tests both wings, and lands beside a blue enamel teacup.\",\"references\":[],\"shot_id\":\"clockmaker-shot\",\"title\":\"The Clockwork Bird\"},\"story_id\":\"clockmaker-shot\",\"title\":\"The Clockwork Bird\",\"video_provider\":{\"endpoint_kind\":\"async-http\",\"model\":\"MiniMax-H3\",\"name\":\"minimax-h3-compatible\"},\"visual_bible\":{\"characters\":[],\"continuity_rules\":[\"Keep recurring character identity, wardrobe, and proportions stable.\",\"Carry visible prop and environment state only across shots that explicitly depend on it.\"],\"locations\":[],\"props\":[],\"style_prompt\":\"A clean cinematic visual style anchor with coherent palette, natural volumetric lighting, production design, and no people, characters, logos, captions, or watermarks.\"},\"visual_search_provider\":{\"endpoint_kind\":\"optional\",\"model\":\"images\",\"name\":\"serpe